{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1619136000, "end_date": 1619827199, "month_true_total": 123, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:03 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "91190812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198855118902", "personaname": "42quanta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198855118902/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 5294, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5200, "last_played": 1619822300, "avatar": "81a33b1909b90e179e84dbf1aa16b338fda1b1b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a decent game with an OK story, fine gameplay, and overall nice visuals, but it could use some additions:\n1. DLC featuring Quarian ark.\n2. Actual facial animations.\n3. Option to airlock Peebee\n4. Option to airlock Liam\n79/100 as it is, solid 86 if list above added (I'm still clinging to my hopes).", "timestamp_created": 1619816596, "timestamp_updated": 1619816596, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91176128", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992168275", "personaname": "Aadu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992168275/", "num_games_owned": 63, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 8307, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4693, "last_played": 1624732617, "avatar": "97599f66cbdf0717fee75a1d64d6e33b9e182c48"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good looking game to explore, not compareble quality story to ME 1-3, but otherwise nice galaxy.", "timestamp_created": 1619797849, "timestamp_updated": 1619797849, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91173279", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033915558", "personaname": "MrCruel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033915558/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 9327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5749, "last_played": 1709249301, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Loved this game. Great story line and never got boring. Highly recommend", "timestamp_created": 1619794432, "timestamp_updated": 1619794432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91166401", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042178526", "personaname": "Theforeseen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/theforeseen/", "num_games_owned": 906, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 1459, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 894, "last_played": 1680294491, "avatar": "9b75cb8641bec11676f66f3d8eb4995ddec08908"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game isn't bad and quite a good way to kill time but buyer be aware that myself and quite a few others are having an issue where no matter how many times you download the game from either origin or steam it will refuse to load and origin will tell you the game isnt installed.\n\nI've been trying to fix this for three days on and off as even though its not an amazing game I bought it and if I want to play it I should be able to. ♥♥♥♥ EA for forcing their terrible broken store front to be used when it doesnt even function correctly.", "timestamp_created": 1619785890, "timestamp_updated": 1619785890, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91112789", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984383125", "personaname": "mulholland", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mulhollandsteam/", "num_games_owned": 382, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 7401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7401, "last_played": 1619712190, "avatar": "59309312841e66a6b3979fef6df9bce21bf189fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "The story kept me engaged even though they had dumbed down the choices in the game, the AI in combat and the fighitng. But the \"tired\" faces, except for the legendary one, wasn't really a problem any more. There is a lot of empty places and quests that annoy you by forcing you to travel between planets and loading screens, but the dialog between your crew and their characters are pretty fun and the main quest is still enjoyable to complete. The fighting gets repetitive, but you can switch it up by refitting your skill points. Meeting an architect the first time is so awesome and colonizing the worlds were also mostly fun. :) give it a try if you liked the old stories of Mass effect.", "timestamp_created": 1619712471, "timestamp_updated": 1619712471, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}